    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 After reaching the heights of the favelas, Jacky embarks on a spaceship that takes him straight to Grekko Island; but as soon as he arrives on this new planet he will have to start an ascent to the skies in this new ONLY UP .\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross abandoned villages, haunted houses, arid deserts, pirate ships reaching thousands of miles in altitude, military bases and Egyptian pyramids returned to life! Reach the highest peak of this mysterious island to learn more about your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Up 3 begins in an idyllic village where the player character, Jacky, must run, climb and jump through various objects and platforms. Along the way, there are thrusters that can be used as trampolines and shortcuts. The player must reach the top of the map to win the game and can use its built-in thruster to benefit from the DOUBLE JUMP. There are no checkpoints and the player cannot save their progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3Try to become the best speedrunner and compare your time with other runners! \ud83c\udfc3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largest map to date </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of speedrunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Ranking </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1* PriMaGeN:\u00a0 22,15 Min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2* LeGrekko:\u00a0 26,32 Min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3* Kaiser003: 28,49 Min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the leaderboard by sharing a video of your performance and your Steam nickname will be in the TOP 3!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/0cddd34d419c85f7a980996e543462c8.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 After reaching the heights of the favelas, Jacky embarks on a spaceship that takes him straight to Grekko Island; but as soon as he arrives on this new planet he will have to start an ascent to the skies in this new ONLY UP .\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/6da4f03805acc5b49b4e4e13a3568e51.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross abandoned villages, haunted houses, arid deserts, pirate ships reaching thousands of miles in altitude, military bases and Egyptian pyramids returned to life! Reach the highest peak of this mysterious island to learn more about your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Up 3 begins in an idyllic village where the player character, Jacky, must run, climb and jump through various objects and platforms. Along the way, there are thrusters that can be used as trampolines and shortcuts. The player must reach the top of the map to win the game and can use its built-in thruster to benefit from the DOUBLE JUMP. There are no checkpoints and the player cannot save their progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.poster.avif?t=1749253296\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.webm?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651480/extras/27828b21d4823e0a78eabd0988af1160.mp4?t=1749253296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3Try to become the best speedrunner and compare your time with other runners! \ud83c\udfc3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largest map to date </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of speedrunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Ranking </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1* PriMaGeN:\u00a0 22,15 Min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2* LeGrekko:\u00a0 26,32 Min </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3* Kaiser003: 28,49 Min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the leaderboard by sharing a video of your performance and your Steam nickname will be in the TOP 3!</p>",
